<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sweet maiden profits at Sweets from Heaven.</title>
<headline>Sweet maiden profits at Sweets from Heaven.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     10.08	 vs 6.83</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 3.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.87	  vs 2.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   6.27	  vs 3.19</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.40	  vs 1.12</p>
<p>    Interest received     1.15	  vs 0.13 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		  24.32	 vs 17.75</p>
<p>Div payable June 2</p>
<p>on register February 28</p>
<p>Full name: Sweets from Heaven Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The newly-listed company had forecast year EPS of 8.63 in its prospectus. The dividend of 3.2 cents was declared at the time of the rights issue announcement in January.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
